        <mxCell id="sqln" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="All replicas write to this one primary. Zone a outage ⇒ the API can't read or write, however well the pods are spread. Kept ZONAL on purpose (dev cost); REGIONAL = standby in a second zone + ~60 s failover, ~2× cost, needs backups." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="740" y="715" width="900" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
